msgctxt "76"
msgid "Why, Kiryu-san, so nice to see you. What can I get you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, I think you've had a little too much to drink. I'd stop now if I "
"were you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Could I interest you in another drink?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Oh, that's too bad. Please stop by again when you have the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Yamazaki is one of Japan's top single malt whiskies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"It's become such a status symbol that whisky aficionados around the world "
"have all heard of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"They use carefully selected, perfectly matured malts to get that great, "
"smooth flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "It's popular overseas, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"This whisky is made at Suntory's Hakushu distillery in Japan's Southern "
"Alps⑬an area famous for its mountain spring water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "The taste is divine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Its fruity, creamy flavor combined with a distinctly smoky accent makes for "
"a superb drinking experience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "I recommend taking the first drink straight up for a pleasantly robust kick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Hibiki, Japan's premium whisky, is appreciated by whisky snobs all over the "
"world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Over thirty types of hand-selected malts are mixed with spirits aged in "
"white oak barrels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"This produces a mellow flavor that's won first-place titles in "
"international taste tests."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "The finish is particularly good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"This malt whisky is the result of extensive research into developing the "
"mildest flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "It really reins in whisky's peculiar taste, making it good for first-timers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"It's quite enjoyable even to those more accustomed to drinking soju and the "
"like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "The bamboo charcoal filtration it goes through ensures a clean, pure taste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "It's particularly good mixed with one part water or soda water on the rocks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "This rectangular bottle is probably the most popular whisky in Japan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Some even call it the father of Japanese whisky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Its popularity shows no signs of waning, even after 70 years on the market."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "It has a sweet aroma, depth, and full body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"The bottle's shape is so unique, some people ask for the \"square bottle\" "
"when they want this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "People have been loving Early Times since the day it came out in 1860."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "It's practically synonymous with bourbon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"The flavor is very American⑬silky to the tongue but with a sharp, clean "
"finish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "The modest price also makes it a wonderful choice for a casual drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"This is a standard scotch, made from a blend of over forty varieties of "
"single malts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Not too heavy, not too light. It's got a great balance to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"And the price isn't too heavy, either. I'd recommend it to casual scotch "
"drinkers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"It also makes for a nice segue into blended whiskies if you've never tried "
"one before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "This is one of Japan's top brandies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid ""
"This bestseller has won over countless people with its bright, fruity aroma "
"and smooth taste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "As for the name..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "V.S.O.P. stands for very superior old pale."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "But you probably already knew that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid ""
"That one's a reasonably priced brandy. You can drink it every day and still "
"not get tired of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid ""
"It's characterized by a clear bouquet and a fruitiness that comes from the "
"freshest grapes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "It has a wonderful aftertaste and is exceptionally easy to drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "You can drink it straight or use it in all sorts of cocktails."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid ""
"The Premium Malt's won Japan's first world title and then kept the title "
"for the next two years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "It's a premium beer by Japanese or even world standards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid ""
"Unbending commitment to ensuring the best ingredients and Suntory's years "
"of brewing know-how produced a delicious, almost magical flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid "I must say, it's a thing of beauty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid ""
"A frosty glass of The Premium Malt's while nibbling sashimi or enjoying a "
"Blu-ray movie on your day off... Ahh... That's the life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "That's a prime example of Korean soju."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid ""
"A spring-water base gives it a clean taste, while premium Korean barley "
"gives it a mellow, rounded feel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "It's quite affordable, too. I'd give it an A+ for cost performance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid ""
"I used to drink this all the time, and its taste is still as familiar as an "
"old friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "It's even better now, thanks to those fond memories."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "This is another extremely popular Japanese whisky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid ""
"Spirits aged in sherry barrels at the Yamazaki Distillery are blended with "
"carefully selected malts and grains."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid ""
"This yields a bright aroma and a sweet fullness in the mouth, and the "
"finish is deep and mellow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid ""
"A lot of people call it \"Daruma,\" because the round shape looks like a "
"daruma doll."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12660"
msgid "Mama"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12664"
msgid "dummy"
msgstr ""